# Density Compare
# Tellurium (Te) — real density 6.24 g/cm³. equal masses: Tellurium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Tellurium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.9mm color: #d47a00 at (-20mm, 5.4mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 49.8 g — the water cube is the reference
